<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>PAKISTAN, Oct 24 - Karachi - Eight vessels waiting off port, of which two general cargo vessels waiting up to two days, three container vessels waiting up to two days, one loader waiting one day and two oil tankers waiting up to three days. Nine vessels off port for own reasons.</p>
</text>
